title: 'asset-hub-westend: deny `AssetRewards::deposit_reward_tokens` to the `NonTransfer` proxy'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `NonTransfer` on Asset Hub Westend now denies `AssetRewards::deposit_reward_tokens`, which
    transfers the caller's tokens into a reward pool. Staking, unstaking and harvesting stay allowed.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
